---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Ladies Room — Ruang Perawatan Privat & Hijab-Friendly: Sonae Beauty Studio Madiun"
  description="Sanctuary kecantikan 100% tertutup dan privat khusus wanita di Sonae Beauty Studio Madiun. Dilayani terapis wanita bersertifikasi, mushola nyaman, dan bebas lepas hijab tanpa was-was. #semuaberhakcakep"
  activePage="ladies-room"
>

  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <!-- HERO LADIES ROOM -->
  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <section class="relative w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 pt-8 sm:pt-12 pb-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      
      <!-- Text Description -->
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col items-start">
        <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#FAF2EB] text-[#7F513C] font-bold text-xs tracking-wider uppercase mb-3">
          100% PRIVAT &amp; HIJAB-FRIENDLY SANCTUARY
        </span>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-[#141414] mb-4 leading-tight">
          Ladies Room Sonae — Merawat Diri Tanpa Was-Was
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#444444] leading-relaxed mb-6 text-justify">
          Kami memahami pentingnya ruang privat dan rasa tenang bagi para muslimah dan wanita yang mengutamakan privasi. Sonae Beauty Studio mempersembahkan **Ladies Room**, area perawatan tertutup eksklusif yang dirancang demi kenyamanan paripurna Anda di Kota Madiun.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <a href="/booking" class="px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#BFAF86] text-[#141414] font-bold text-sm hover:brightness-95 shadow-sm transition-all">
            Reservasi Slot Ladies Room
          </a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Halo%20Sonae,%20saya%20mau%20tanya%20reservasi%20Ladies%20Room" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white text-[#141414] font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-[#FAF2EB] shadow-sm transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#25D366] text-[20px]">chat</span>
            <span>Konsultasi WhatsApp</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Hero Visual (Borderless) -->
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 aspect-[4/3] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-soft-card">
        <img 
          src="/images/ladies_room.webp" 
          alt="Ladies Room Privat & Hijab-Friendly di Sonae Beauty Studio Madiun" 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
        />
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <!-- 4 PILAR KENYAMANAN LADIES ROOM -->
  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <section class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#7F513C] block mb-1">STANDAR PRIVASI TINGGI</span>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#141414]">Kenyamanan Eksklusif untuk Anda</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-soft-card flex flex-col items-start">
        <div class="size-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF2EB] text-[#7F513C] flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">door_front</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-[#141414] mb-2">100% Ruang Tertutup</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#555555] leading-relaxed">
          Ruangan bersekat khusus dengan tirai akustik kedap dan frosted glass. Bebas sepenuhnya dari pandangan lalu lalang luar.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-soft-card flex flex-col items-start">
        <div class="size-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF2EB] text-[#7F513C] flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">face_3</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-[#141414] mb-2">Terapis Wanita Ahli</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#555555] leading-relaxed">
          Seluruh proses perawatan rambut, creambath, dan relaksasi dikerjakan oleh tim terapis wanita bersertifikasi resmi.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-soft-card flex flex-col items-start">
        <div class="size-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF2EB] text-[#7F513C] flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">spa</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-[#141414] mb-2">Wash Basin Privat</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#555555] leading-relaxed">
          Tempat cuci rambut keramik ergonomis berada langsung di dalam Ladies Room, sehingga Anda tak perlu berpindah ke area umum.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-soft-card flex flex-col items-start">
        <div class="size-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF2EB] text-[#7F513C] flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">mosque</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-[#141414] mb-2">Mushola &amp; Wudhu</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#555555] leading-relaxed">
          Tersedia mushola bersih lengkap dengan mukena steril dan tempat wudhu khusus, memudahkan Anda menunaikan ibadah tepat waktu.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <!-- PERAWATAN FAVORIT HIJABERS -->
  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <section class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-10">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-[#F4EFEA] p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-12 shadow-soft-card">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#7F513C] block mb-1">SPESIALISASI HIJAB CARE</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#141414]">Perawatan Populer di Ladies Room</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-[#7F513C] uppercase tracking-wider">SOLUSI RAMBUT LEPEK</span>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-[#141414] mt-1 mb-2">Hijab Scalp Detox &amp; Creambath</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#555555] leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Menyegarkan kulit kepala yang sering tertutup hijab. Mengatasi ketombe, minyak berlebih, dan rasa gatal dengan sensasi dingin mint herbal.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-neutral-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-bold text-base text-[#141414]">Rp 85.000</span>
            <a href="/booking" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#7F513C] text-white font-bold text-xs hover:bg-[#633B2A] transition-all">Pesan Slot</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-[#7F513C] uppercase tracking-wider">LURUS ALAMI TERTUTUP</span>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-[#141414] mt-1 mb-2">Korean Silk Smoothing Privat</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#555555] leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Dikerjakan 100% di ruang tertutup. Rambut lurus halus berkilau, mudah ditata dan tidak mudah kusut saat mengenakan inner hijab.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-neutral-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-bold text-base text-[#141414]">Rp 250.000</span>
            <a href="/booking" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#7F513C] text-white font-bold text-xs hover:bg-[#633B2A] transition-all">Pesan Slot</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-[#7F513C] uppercase tracking-wider">MATA SEGAR ALAMI</span>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-[#141414] mt-1 mb-2">Keratin Lash Lift &amp; Brow</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#555555] leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Lentik natural tanpa eyelash extension dan wudhu-friendly. Mata tampak segar berseri meskipun mengenakan masker.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-neutral-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-bold text-base text-[#141414]">Rp 80.000</span>
            <a href="/booking" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#7F513C] text-white font-bold text-xs hover:bg-[#633B2A] transition-all">Pesan Slot</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <!-- FAQ LADIES ROOM -->
  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <section class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 py-10">
    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-center text-[#141414] mb-8">Pertanyaan Seputar Ladies Room</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-soft-card">
        <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-base text-[#141414] mb-2">Apakah ada biaya tambahan untuk memakai Ladies Room?</h4>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#555555] leading-relaxed">
          Tidak ada biaya tambahan! Fasilitas Ladies Room dapat dinikmati secara gratis untuk seluruh pilihan perawatan kami. Kami menyarankan untuk melakukan reservasi terlebih dahulu agar slot ruangan dipersiapkan khusus untuk Anda.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-soft-card">
        <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-base text-[#141414] mb-2">Apakah bisa reservasi berdua bersama ibu atau sahabat?</h4>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#555555] leading-relaxed">
          Tentu bisa! Ladies Room kami dapat menampung hingga 2-3 orang sekaligus sehingga Anda bisa merawat diri bersama sahabat atau keluarga terdekat secara privat.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<script>
  import { gsap } from 'gsap';

  function initLadiesRoom() {
    gsap.from('h1, h2', {
      opacity: 0,
      y: 20,
      duration: 0.7,
      stagger: 0.15,
      ease: 'power3.out'
    });

    gsap.from('.rounded-3xl, .rounded-2xl', {
      opacity: 0,
      y: 25,
      duration: 0.8,
      stagger: 0.08,
      ease: 'power2.out'
    });
  }

  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initLadiesRoom);
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initLadiesRoom);
</script>
